  "question": {
    "text": "The area of the region included between the curves <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
